{"id":"wb-7-1251","name":"芷江天后宫","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"芷江天后宫","text":"芷江天后宫位于中国湖南省怀化市芷江侗族自治县芷江镇江西街八十三号。始建于清康熙年间，后于清乾隆十三年(1748年)由福建客商扩建为福建商会会馆，是中国内陆现存规模最大的妈祖庙古建筑。\n1986年被列为湖南省级文物保护单位，2013年5月被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%B7%E6%B1%9F%E5%A4%A9%E5%90%8E%E5%AE%AB","revisionId":93690498,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93690498","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4c0048181db26f107a59843e.jpg","title":"芷江天后宫石坊.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%8A%B7%E6%B1%9F%E5%A4%A9%E5%90%8E%E5%AE%AB%E7%9F%B3%E5%9D%8A.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a2/%E8%8A%B7%E6%B1%9F%E5%A4%A9%E5%90%8E%E5%AE%AB%E7%9F%B3%E5%9D%8A.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​芷江天后宫石坊。","width":320,"height":213}}